# .gitignore
# Why: keeps build outputs and packaged zips out of the repository (SPEC 22.1).
# Owns: the repo-wide ignore rules. The PROS projects keep their own .gitignore too.

# MkDocs site output
site/

# Build outputs (laptop tests, PROS)
build/
bin/
.d/

# Packaged zips (pros make template, starter zips). Release copies go in release/ on purpose.
*.zip
!release/*.zip
